                "loc": "ROM.14.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 14:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.10.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 10:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TH.5.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tes 5:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaabyama aha bigyere bye, bwarugaho bwasheesha; yaimuka butakahwerize, ahu omuntu ateetegyerereza mugyenzi we; ahabw'okuba Boazi akagira ngu kirekye kumanywa ku ogwo mukazi aizire aha mbuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaamugira ati: Reeta ogwo munagiro gu ojwaire, ogutegye. Onu yaagumutega; yaamushukiraho encuro mukaaga za sayiri, yaazimukorera; Ruusi yaataaha omu rurembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaahikire owa nyinazaara, nyinazaara yaamubuuza ati: Bigyenzire bita, mwana wangye? Ruusi yaamugambira ebi ogwo mushaija amukoreire byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ati: Ezi ncuro mukaaga za sayiri niwe yaazimpa; ahakuba yangira ati: Otagaruka ahari nyokozaara engaro nsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi yaamugira ati: Yeshutamire, mwana wangye, okuhitsya ahu oraamanyire oku biraabe; ahabw'okuba ogwo mushaija tarikwija kuhuumura atakabiherize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
